<title>POLAND: Ocean to pay PLN 0.5 mln in 96 dividends.</title>
<headline>Ocean to pay PLN 0.5 mln in 96 dividends.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Polish retailer Ocean Company SA have voted to pay dividends of 0.5 million zlotys from last year's 1.8 million zloty net profit, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Ocean said the record date would be July 7 and the pay date not later than December 31, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
